# =============================================================================
# Cloudflare Workers & Pages — projet "dartchain" (monorepo GitHub)
# =============================================================================
#
# Dashboard : Workers & Pages → dartchain → Settings → Build
#
# | Champ              | Valeur                                      |
# |--------------------|---------------------------------------------|
# | Root directory     | /  (racine du repo)                         |
# | Build command      | bash scripts/cloudflare-build.sh            |
# | Deploy command     | bash scripts/cloudflare-deploy.sh           |
# | Node.js version    | 22                                          |
#
# ⚠️  NE PAS utiliser `npx wrangler deploy` sur un projet Pages.
#     Utiliser `bash scripts/cloudflare-deploy.sh` (wrangler pages deploy).
#
# Build variables (obligatoire) :
BACKEND_URL=https://YOUR-BACKEND.onrender.com
#
# Fichiers repo :
#   scripts/cloudflare-build.sh  → npm ci + build Angular → dist/browser
#   scripts/cloudflare-deploy.sh → npx wrangler pages deploy
#   wrangler.toml                → pages_build_output_dir (référence)
#
# =============================================================================
# Alternative : Pages classique (sans commande deploy custom)
# =============================================================================
#
# Create application → Pages → Connect to Git
# Root directory     : apps/dartchain-frontend/Dart
# Build command      : npm ci && npm run build:cloudflare
# Build output dir   : dist/browser
# (pas de deploy command — Cloudflare publie dist/browser automatiquement)
